                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Among Ripples (2015, free, by Eat Create Sleep) is a short, meditative pond ecosystem sandbox. You add creatures pike, clams, otters tweak oxygen levels, and watch what happens.\n\nSteam user reviews sit at \"Mixed,\" around 68% positive from roughly 1,400 reviews. Rock Paper Shotgun called it \"quite relaxing,\" praising its watercolor aesthetic and gentle music, while noting it's a small, simple sandbox where you set your own goals. One HowLongToBeat user was harsher, rating it 3/10 and saying there \"wasn't much of a game or goal.\"\n\nIn short: a gentle, pretty toy rather than a game with objectives charming if you want to unwind, thin if you want direction.",
